<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-W TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 13.8.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-W TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 13.8.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 500,000 shares in Polifarb Wroclaw at 13.8 zlotys was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Friday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session, Polifarb Wroclaw traded at 14.1 zlotys in 105,044 share volume.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
